WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.600
Film Courage: I think you've said 20&nbsp;
percent of all writers are really good&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:05.100
and 10 percent are great?

