Kelly Edwards, Staff Writer, Author, Producer:&nbsp;
That's what I saw when I was doing the HBO Access&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:09.840 --> 00:00:23.100
Program. Every year we had about 3,500 submissions&nbsp;
to our writers program and when we did the math&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:24.180 --> 00:00:30.840
we found that 20 percent of those&nbsp;
writers were all good, they were good.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:33.540 --> 00:00:39.300
80 percent of them were probably just not ready&nbsp;
but 20 percent were good and any of those 20&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:39.300 --> 00:00:46.800
percent could or should be working in the business&nbsp;
and they came from everywhere, all demographics.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:48.180 --> 00:00:56.400
Ten percent were really good, ten percent are&nbsp;
all people who were very worthy of being in the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:56.400 --> 00:01:03.840
program. It's not that the talent's not there, the&nbsp;
